Rules:
  [T1] Use OpenTelemetry for vendor-neutral tracing.
  [T2] Propagate trace context across service boundaries.
  [T3] Use consistent trace ID format.
  [T4] Sample traces appropriately (1-10% in production).
  [T5] Add span attributes for context.
  [T6] Use span events for notable occurrences.
  [T7] Implement trace-to-logs correlation.
  [T8] Monitor trace latency and error rates.

Pros:
  - Distributed debugging
  - Performance insights
  - Dependency mapping

Cons:
  - Overhead
  - Storage cost
  - Privacy concerns

Alternatives:
  - Metrics only
  - Logs only
  - APM

State: +

